  "sardrag": [
    {
      "text": "Refleksol 125 is a modern exterior shading system, mounted on the building's façade. It is characterized by simple assembly, where the cassette is fixed to the cable guides, which in connection with the brackets create the load-bearing element for the cassette.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "pdf.archiexpo.com",
        "url": "https://pdf.archiexpo.com/pdf/selt-sun-protection-systems/refleksol/65037-213263.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Maximum size: width 3.5 m, height 4.25 m, construction available in any color from RAL palette, wide range of fabrics, electric drive. Refleksol 125 provides the possibility of modular assembly.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "pdf.archiexpo.com",
        "url": "https://pdf.archiexpo.com/pdf/selt-sun-protection-systems/refleksol/65037-213263.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The cassette is made from extruded aluminum, unlike cassettes made from aluminum sheet it does not resonate in rain. It is screw-mounted directly to the cable using clamps.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "pdf.archiexpo.com",
        "url": "https://pdf.archiexpo.com/pdf/selt-sun-protection-systems/refleksol/65037-213263.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Refleksol ZIIIP is a textile roller blind designed to keep the fabric in constant tension regardless of its position. This solution allows us to enjoy the functionality of the blind even in strong gusty winds.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "pdf.archiexpo.com",
        "url": "https://pdf.archiexpo.com/pdf/selt-sun-protection-systems/refleksol/65037-213263.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cassette dimensions (ZIIIP): 113 mm wide, 128 mm high, maximum dimensions: width 3.5 m, height 4.0 m.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "pdf.archiexpo.com",
        "url": "https://pdf.archiexpo.com/pdf/selt-sun-protection-systems/refleksol/65037-213263.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ziiip system, thanks to its arrangement of compensating gaskets, provides a complete blackout effect, even with very uneven façades. It is the only solution of this type for external usage.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "pdf.archiexpo.com",
        "url": "https://pdf.archiexpo.com/pdf/selt-sun-protection-systems/refleksol/65037-213263.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two-piece guide with a system of compensating seals. Refleksol zip standardly equipped with an electric motor.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "shopsun.eu",
        "url": "https://shopsun.eu/concealing-facade-sun-screen-ziiip-120-built-in-concealed/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ZIP system – the fabric is guided in guides using a zipper principle, which ensures its high stability even in strong winds and allows it to function as a mosquito net.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "door-filipek.pl",
        "url": "https://door-filipek.pl/en/professional-installation-of-screen-zip-or-reflective-sunshades-with-mosquito-net-function/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wind resistance class 6 (Screen ZIIIP 95 variant); Zip mechanism; Two-piece guide with compensating seal system; Self-supporting system; Modules can be created using module handles.",
      "kalla": {
        "domän": "okno-pol.com",
        "url": "https://okno-pol.com/offer/products/sun-protection-systems/reflective-blinds/549,screen-ziiip-95"
      }
